## 3.7. The Jordan-Holder theorem
%%%
tag := "Chapter3/Introduction_to_3.7/heading-1"
%%%

We will now state and prove two important theorems about representations of finite dimensional algebras — the Jordan-Holder theorem and the Krull-Schmidt theorem.
